XIO FRONTEND CONTRACT

SOURCE
  -> TOKENS
  -> AST
  -> RESOLVED AST
  -> VALIDATED AST

The frontend owns:
    syntax
    names
    types
    ownership
    lifetimes
    semantic rules

The frontend does not own:
    machine registers
    instruction encoding
    ELF layout
    final linking

The frontend passes target-independent semantic information
to the middleend and backend.
